<div class="wrap">
  <div class="page-title">Jorgensen Foundation — Logo Variations</div>
  <p class="page-sub"><strong>Direction 1: molecular node-and-bond cluster.</strong> Eight executions (A–H) of the chosen mark · Midnight #302C2E · wordmark in Cormorant Garamond.<br>Each shows the lockup (light), scalability at 24/48/80px, and inverted on Midnight (the real nav background).</p>
  <span class="temp">Temporary preview — not linked, will be deleted</span>

  <!-- ===== INTERLOCKED SERIF "JF" MONOGRAM — STATIC inline SVG (no JS dependency) ===== -->
  <section class="card">
    <div class="card-h"><span class="dnum">JF serif</span><span class="dname">Interlocked high-contrast serif “JF” monogram — V1–V6</span></div>
    <p class="page-sub" style="margin-top:-1rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem">Shared central stem (the J's stem doubles as the F's), J terminating in a swash tail curling lower-left, Didone-style thick/thin contrast. Static inline SVG paths, currentColor (so they invert cream-on-Midnight). Each: large on light + inverted, plus 16/32px favicon stress test.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="card">
    <div class="card-h"><span class="dnum">V1</span><span class="dname">Faithful — shared stem, lower-left swash, high-contrast serif</span></div>
    <p class="pair-note">The reference, refined: balanced swash, flat Didone serifs, pointed tail.</p>
